<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; color: #231F20"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>EXTRAORDINARY
GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: #231F20"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The
board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board</B>&rdquo;) of Zhihu Inc. (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;) announces that the record date for
the purpose of determining the eligibility of the holders of the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares and the Class&nbsp;B Ordinary Shares, par
value US$0.000125 each (the &ldquo;<B>Ordinary Shares</B>&rdquo;), to vote and attend the forthcoming extraordinary general meeting of
the Company (the &ldquo;<B>EGM</B>&rdquo;), will be as of the close of business on Monday, September&nbsp;21, 2026, Hong Kong time (the
&ldquo;<B>Ordinary Share Record Date</B>&rdquo;).</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: #231F20"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">In
order to be eligible to vote and attend the EGM, with respect to Shares registered on the Company&rsquo;s branch share register in Hong
Kong, all valid documents for the transfers of shares accompanied by the relevant share certificates must be lodged with the Company&rsquo;s
Hong Kong branch share registrar and transfer office, Computershare Hong Kong Investor Services Limited, Shops 1712-1716, 17th Floor,
Hopewell Centre, 183 Queen&rsquo;s Road East, Wan Chai, Hong Kong, no later than 4:30 p.m.&nbsp;on Monday, September&nbsp;21, 2026, Hong
Kong time; and with respect to Shares registered on the Company&rsquo;s principal share register in the Cayman Islands, all valid documents
for the transfers of shares accompanied by the relevant share certificates must be lodged with the Company&rsquo;s principal share registrar
and transfer office, Maples Fund Services (Cayman) Limited, PO Box 1093, Boundary Hall, Cricket Square, Grand Cayman, KY1-1102, Cayman
Islands, no later than 6:00 p.m.&nbsp;on Sunday, September&nbsp;20, 2026, Cayman Islands time (due to the time difference between the
Cayman Islands and Hong Kong). All persons who are registered holders of the Shares on the Ordinary Share Record Date will be entitled
to vote and attend the EGM.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: #231F20"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Holders
of American depositary shares (the &ldquo;<B>ADSs</B>&rdquo;) issued by JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. as the depositary of the ADSs (the
&ldquo;<B>Depositary</B>&rdquo;), each representing three Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares of the Company, may attend, but may not vote at,
the EGM. The ADS holders as of the close of business on Monday, September&nbsp;21, 2026, New York time (the &ldquo;<B>ADS Record Date</B>&rdquo;,
together with the Ordinary Share Record Date, the &ldquo;<B>Record Date</B>&rdquo;), will be able to instruct the Depositary, being the
holder of record of the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares represented by the ADSs, as to how to vote the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares represented
by such ADSs. The Depositary will endeavor, to the extent practicable and legally permissible, to vote or cause to be voted at the EGM
the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares represented by the ADSs in accordance with the instructions that it has properly received from the ADS
holders. Please be aware that, because of the time difference between Hong Kong and New York, any ADS holders that cancel their ADSs
in exchange for Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares on Monday, September&nbsp;21, 2026, New York time will no longer be ADS holders with respect
to such canceled ADSs as of the ADS Record Date and will not be able to instruct the Depositary as to how to vote the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary
Shares represented by such canceled ADSs as described above; such ADS holders will also not be holders of the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares
represented by such canceled ADSs as of the Ordinary Share Record Date for the purpose of determining the eligibility to attend and vote
at the EGM.</FONT></P>

